      ],
      "description": "The content layer's Tool nodes. Declared 2026-09-22 with the first one, `folio-changeset` (bean jwox, epic q4jm), which exposes `schemas/changeset.ts`. Reached by the harness through tool auto-discovery (bean p0za, owner ruling 2026-09-22), never by an import: the harness may not import core, and a Tool node is a declaration loaded by path.",
      "readmePath": "tools/README.md",
      "fileCount": 2,
      "inSubgraph": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/folio-assistant-core/folio-assistant-core.jsonld#directory/core-tools"
